values ('K131', 'Can I get paid to care for my family member?', 'Through Missouri Consumer Directed Services, a family member other than a spouse can sometimes be paid as the attendant, when the person receiving care is eligible for Medicaid. That is handled by our sister company, Caring Companions Consumer Directed Services, at (417) 218-2888 or caringcds.com.', 'cds_jobs', 'S7', array['cds','paid','family','medicaid']::text[], array['How do I get paid to take care of my mom?','Can I be paid as my dad''s caregiver through Medicaid?']::text[], array[]::text[], array[]::text[], 'verified', 'public', 95, false, '2026-10-27', 'mo-care.com live pages (Claude, her ask 10-27)', 'na', 'na', 'ok', 1)
